&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role is on-site, and will be based out of our Scout Motors location in Charlotte, North Carolina.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
