&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This team is focused on development, deployment and management of manufacturing and logistics systems and IT infrastructure interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Daily Responsibilities of the Internship Program include&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams (Data Engineers, IT Business Partners, Security, etc.) and gather requirements for onboarding new data sets&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist in developing data governance policies such as access control, data classification, standards and best practices for BI repots/visualizations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in the enhancement of existing data pipelines (ETL/ELT) and the creation of new features to meet business requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help implement observability and monitoring solutions for data workflows&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain clear documentation on data assets, metadata management, data cataloging and governance processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather feedback and make improvements to existing data platform processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
