&lt;li&gt;Support in vehicle planning and test trip preparation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support in the set up and maintenance of measurement equipment and learn how they are used for the calibration of software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
