&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The platform engineering team is focused on development and design of interfaces supporting all of Scout’s engineering teams.&amp;nbsp; As platform engineers we have a positive impact on all engineering teams at Scout by providing interfaces and APIs to enable teams to move fast through automation and tooling.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Daily Responsibilities of the Internship Program include&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams (Data Engineers, IT Business Partners, Security, etc.) to gather requirements, interfaces design and backend systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy cloud infrastructure using Infrastructure as Code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhance CI/CD automations and tooling through building integrations with APIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve tooling visualizations and reporting related to improving developer experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather feedback and make improvements to existing platform processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
