&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;This role is on-site, and will be based out of our Scout Motors location in &lt;strong&gt;Columbia, SC&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt; The responsibilities of this role require daily attendance at in-person meetings and events regularly.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
