&lt;p&gt;Siemens Nx CAD experience&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience manufacturing using filament winders, autoclaves, lathes, mills, and hydraulic presses&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
