&lt;p&gt;Experience in a digitally connected manufacturing environment (PLM, ERP, ERP, WMS)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Strong interpersonal skills&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
