&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; (pandas, scikit-learn, NumPy).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience using &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; to work with analytical databases and data warehouses.&lt;/li&gt;
