&lt;li&gt;Experience with cloud platforms (AWS, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of ML Ops tools (MLflow, Airflow, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to big data technologies (Redshift, Snowflake).&lt;/li&gt;
