&lt;h2&gt;Projects You May Work On&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2870&quot; data-end=&quot;2993&quot;&gt;Intern projects will be tailored to company needs and student skillsets closer to the start date. Typical projects include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Procedure generation to build and test spacecraft&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Ground Support Equipment (GSE) design&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Test development and execution&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Flight hardware upgrades and modifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Automating vehicle testing and data review&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
