&lt;li&gt;1+ years of hands-on technical engineering experience&amp;nbsp;(internship and school projects experience qualify)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PREFERRED SKILLS AND EXPERIENCE:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
