&lt;p data-start=&quot;2116&quot; data-end=&quot;2203&quot;&gt;Develop and maintain Python-based tools that interface with flight and ground systems&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2204&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2206&quot; data-end=&quot;2272&quot;&gt;Assist in scripting and automation to support mission operations&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2273&quot; data-end=&quot;2364&quot;&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;2275&quot; data-end=&quot;2364&quot;&gt;Contribute to backend systems used for telemetry, data processing, or test coordination&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;2365&quot; data-end=&quot;2471&quot;&gt;
