&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Position is based in Redmond, WA and requires being onsite - remote work not considered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be willing to work long hours and weekends when needed to meet critical deadlines&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to travel: Up to 25-50% work week travel may be required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Valid driver’s license&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
