&lt;p&gt;Space Lasers Engineer/Level I: $105,000.00 - $120,000.00/per year&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Space Lasers Engineer/Level II: $115,000.00 - $145,000.00/per year &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
