&lt;li&gt;Experience with Go and Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in IAM, non‑human/machine identities, secrets management, workload identities, OAuth/OIDC, SCIM, SSO, or policy engines.&lt;/li&gt;
