&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Software Engineer/Level I: $122,500.00 - $145,000.00/per year&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in; font-family: Arial; font-size: 11.0pt;&quot;&gt;Software Engineer/Level II: $140,000.00 - $170,000.00/per year&lt;/p&gt;
