&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data Privacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;To view Anduril&#39;s candidate data privacy policy, please visit &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-charstyle=&quot;Hyperlink&quot;&gt;https://anduril.com/applicant-privacy-notice/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Anduril Industries is a defense technology company with a mission to transform U.S. and allied military capabilities with advanced technology. By bringing the expertise, technology, and business model of the 21st century’s most innovative companies to the defense industry, Anduril is changing how military systems are designed, built and sold. Anduril’s family of systems is powered by Lattice OS, an AI-powered operating system that turns thousands of data streams into a realtime, 3D command and control center. As the world enters an era of strategic competition, Anduril is committed to bringing cutting-edge autonomy, AI, computer vision, sensor fusion, and networking technology to the military in months, not years.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE TEAM&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Connected Warfare Division builds mission-critical systems that enable global command and control for time-sensitive, multi-domain operations. By fusing robotics, sensor networks, and advanced software, we create connected mesh ecosystems that empower our military partners with a comprehensive source of truth for rapid decision-making. Our Mission Command group is at the forefront of delivering software solutions that integrate seamlessly with hundreds of thousands of endpoints worldwide, ensuring operational superiority on a global scale.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT THE JOB&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;As the Chief Engineer, you will lead end-to-end efforts for a high-stakes, mission-critical project across the European Theatre. You will head a technical team charged with developing and implementing a &quot;mesh of meshes&quot; that integrates fractured C2 systems, enables DDIL-resistant capabilities, and delivers mission autonomy at both the product and sector C2 levels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Primary technical counter-part to 4-star US Army Europe Chief Technology Officer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the design and implementation of innovative solutions that integrate diverse command and control (C2) systems to ensure robust and resilient communications across US, NATO and European country networks and systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High impact work with hardware, product, design, and other teams to build a best-in-class solution that safeguards the users and delivers operational excellence for a 4-star command on their highest priority effort with operational efficacy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High visibility opportunity to lead across Anduril teams and creating solutions from across multiple Anduril business lines to create a holistic solution for Europe, leveraging the full breadth of Anduril’s capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to product vision and roadmap formulation through an in-depth understanding of customer requirements and deployment/sustainment pain points, ensuring real-world challenges shape our innovations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own technical product and programmatic success across the European Theatre, ensuring delivered solutions meet both operational and strategic objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and develop the next generation of engineering leaders, equipping them to manage and own country/sub-region priorities and programs effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;REQUIRED QUALIFICATIONS&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Our ideal candidate will be located in Germany but we will consider candidates in Europe who are eligible to work in this location and can travel to Germany and or other locations up to 50% of the time.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s of Science, Masters or PhD in an engineering field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in leading complex systems engineering initiatives, preferably in a defense or mission-critical technology environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive understanding of mesh networking, C2 systems, and resilient communications in challenged operational contexts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to collaborate across diverse technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong leadership skills with a track record of mentoring and developing engineering talent.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent strategic thinking, problem-solving abilities, and a hands-on approach to driving technical success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently possesses and is able to maintain an active U.S. Top Secret Clearance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;US Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$191,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$336,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;The salary range for this role is an estimate based on a wide range of compensation factors, inclusive of base salary only. Actual salary offer may vary based on (but not limited to) work experience, education and/or training, critical skills, and/or business considerations. Highly competitive equity grants are included in the majority of full time offers; and are considered part of Anduril&#39;s total compensation package. Additionally, Anduril offers top-tier benefits for full-time employees, including:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
