&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years of experience in a government contracting role. i.e. civil or defense&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bachelor’s degree in Computer Science, Electrical Engineering, or related discipline&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiar with writing and executing requirements from customer needs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading cross functional projects and teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly attuned to project status. Able to quickly identifies roadblocks to the appropriate team by looking at logs, reviewing behavior diagrams, making test cases etc.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent verbal &amp;amp; written communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with basic framework of taking a product from ideation to production&lt;/li&gt;
