&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;CMM Programming Renishaw REVO and/or PH20&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Knowledge of Aerospace hardware specifications, coating/processes, assemblies, etc. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience at an Aerospace or automotive start-up Good computer skills including Microsoft Word, Excel, and Outlook &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
