&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Experience with AS9100, ISO9001, or similar QMS Basic CNC skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
