&lt;p&gt;Varda Space Industries is an Equal Opportunity Employer. &amp;nbsp;We celebrate diversity and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for all employees.&amp;nbsp; Candidates and employees are always evaluated based on merit, qualifications, and performance.&amp;nbsp; We will never discriminate on the basis of race, color, gender, national origin, ethnicity, veteran status, disability status, age, sexual orientation, gender identity, martial status, mental or physical disability, or any other legally protected status.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
