&lt;li&gt;Develop tools for software development and deployment, data analysis and visualization, and test execution across multiple environments, including virtualized hardware environments, real hardware-in-the-loop simulations, and on-orbit testing. reliable software deployment, test execution, and data analysis as part of a continuous integration and release system.&lt;/li&gt;
